s-serif;">KAPOK KNOTが目指している世界や取り組みの想いを是非聞いてみて下さい！</span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">こちらのアカウントより配信やスケジュールの告知が行われます。</span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kishow_kapok/" style="max-width: 100%; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: underline; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;">深井喜翔のインスタグラムアカウント</a></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1632577695230" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1632577695230"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px;"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">まとめ</span></span></strong><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629622187833" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629622187833" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/7929c2bf-52f4-43f5-a103-ff9843e69765/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E2%91%A8.jpeg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" width="2048" height="1365" natural-width="2048" natural-height="1365"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629622197316" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpic